1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":"Thinkinghaus"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Links"}],null,null]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-I have never been especially good at bookmarks. Things end up in open tabs, notes, screenshots, messages to myself, and occasionally in the part of my brain apparently reserved for URLs from 2003.",{"children":["I have never been especially good at bookmarks. Things end up in open tabs, notes, screenshots, messages to myself, and occasionally in the part of my brain apparently reserved for URLs from 2003."]}],["$","p","1-This is an attempt to keep a few of them somewhere more useful.",{"children":["This is an attempt to keep a few of them somewhere more useful."]}],["$","p","2-These are places I return to, places I expect to return to, and places that have sent me somewhere I would not have found by searching for what I thought I wanted. Some are resources. Some are people. Some are entire little worlds.",{"children":["These are places I return to, places I expect to return to, and places that have sent me somewhere I would not have found by searching for what I thought I wanted. Some are resources. Some are people. Some are entire little worlds."]}],["$","p","3-The categories are approximate.",{"children":["The categories are approximate."]}],["$","p","4-*Inhabited sites*",{"children":[["$","em","0",{"children":"Inhabited sites"}]]}],["$","p","5-[Hundred Rabbits](https://100r.co/)",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://100r.co/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Hundred Rabbits"]}]]}],["$","p","6-Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega make software, games, books, music, tools, and other things while living aboard a sailboat and thinking seriously about technological resilience. Their line—“That which cannot be repaired is already broken”—has been lodged in my head since I found it.",{"children":["Rekka Bellum and Devine Lu Linvega make software, games, books, music, tools, and other things while living aboard a sailboat and thinking seriously about technological resilience. Their line—“That which cannot be repaired is already broken”—has been lodged in my head since I found it."]}],["$","p","7-There is a lot here.",{"children":["There is a lot here."]}],["$","p","8-[A Working Library](https://aworkinglibrary.com/)",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://aworkinglibrary.com/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["A Working Library"]}]]}],["$","p","9-Mandy Brown’s ongoing library of reading, work, technology, and thought. I like that the site feels accumulated rather than produced. Books lead to notes, notes lead elsewhere, and the whole thing remains visibly in use.",{"children":["Mandy Brown’s ongoing library of reading, work, technology, and thought. I like that the site feels accumulated rather than produced. Books lead to notes, notes lead elsewhere, and the whole thing remains visibly in use."]}],["$","p","10-[Scope of Work](https://www.scopeofwork.net/)",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://www.scopeofwork.net/","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Scope of Work"]}]]}],["$","p","11-Work in its unusually broad sense: tools, machinery, maintenance, competence, labor, curiosity, and the strange reasons people become interested in doing difficult things well.",{"children":["Work in its unusually broad sense: tools, machinery, maintenance, competence, labor, curiosity, and the strange reasons people become interested in doing difficult things well."]}],"$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d